# The Node the installer downloads when the computer has no suitable one (app/install.sh, sourced),
# and the one `./td release` checks the app on. Its SHA-256s, from nodejs.org's SHASUMS256.txt:
# a download that doesn't match is refused. Change it with ./td node-pin <version>.
